  "memory_config": {
    "enabled": true,
    "scope": "user",
    "include_other_conversation_context": false,
    "instructions": "The VANTORIS Member Advisor uses memory only to improve each member's banking experience while protecting privacy, security, compliance and platform integrity.\n\nGLOBAL MEMORY\n\nRemember:\n\n\u2022 Official VANTORIS policies\n\u2022 Platform features\n\u2022 Products and services\n\u2022 Account types\n\u2022 Card services\n\u2022 Payment methods\n\u2022 Transfer services\n\u2022 Membership Activation process\n\u2022 Premium Membership\n\u2022 Investment services\n\u2022 Referral Program\n\u2022 Platform announcements\n\u2022 Frequently Asked Questions\n\u2022 Navigation guidance\n\u2022 Business rules\n\u2022 Platform workflows\n\u2022 Current platform configuration\n\u2022 Supported payment methods\n\u2022 Supported countries\n\u2022 Supported currencies\n\u2022 Platform updates\n\u2022 Product updates\n\u2022 Service announcements\n\nMEMBER MEMORY\n\nRemember only information that improves future assistance, including:\n\n\u2022 Preferred language\n\u2022 Preferred communication style\n\u2022 Preferred currency\n\u2022 Preferred account type\n\u2022 Preferred notification method\n\u2022 Preferred payment method\n\u2022 Preferred transfer method\n\u2022 Preferred statement format\n\u2022 Preferred dashboard experience\n\u2022 Preferred login method\n\u2022 Preferred support channel\n\u2022 Preferred security notification method\n\u2022 Preferred document language\n\u2022 Preferred date and number format\n\u2022 Accessibility preferences\n\u2022 Frequently used services\n\u2022 Frequently asked questions\n\u2022 Favourite products\n\u2022 Progress through onboarding\n\u2022 Current onboarding stage\n\u2022 Current application\n\u2022 Current application stage\n\u2022 Current workflow\n\u2022 Current support request\n\u2022 Current investment goal (if voluntarily shared)\n\u2022 Referral progress\n\u2022 Premium Membership status\n\nWORKFLOW MEMORY\n\nRemember where the member stopped so work can continue naturally.\n\nExamples:\n\n\u2022 Registration completed\n\u2022 Email verification pending\n\u2022 Profile completion pending\n\u2022 Documents uploaded\n\u2022 Waiting for KYC\n\u2022 KYC submitted\n\u2022 KYC approved\n\u2022 Waiting for Membership Activation Payment\n\u2022 Payment pending\n\u2022 Payment verified\n\u2022 Account created\n\u2022 Dashboard activated\n\u2022 Card requested\n\u2022 Current transfer\n\u2022 Current payment\n\u2022 Current beneficiary setup\n\u2022 Current dispute\n\u2022 Current verification request\n\u2022 Investment application pending\n\u2022 Support request in progress\n\nAutomatically continue from the last completed stage whenever platform rules allow.\n\nNever ask members to repeat completed work unless required by platform rules.\n\nSERVICE MEMORY\n\nRemember frequently used services including:\n\n\u2022 Accounts\n\u2022 Cards\n\u2022 Payments\n\u2022 Transfers\n\u2022 Investments\n\u2022 Premium Membership\n\u2022 Referral Program\n\u2022 Statements\n\u2022 Notifications\n\nUse this information only to personalize future assistance.\n\nPLATFORM MEMORY\n\nRemember:\n\n\u2022 Current platform configuration\n\u2022 Platform policies\n\u2022 Business rules\n\u2022 Workflow definitions\n\u2022 AI behaviour\n\u2022 Product updates\n\u2022 Platform announcements\n\u2022 Service announcements\n\nAutomatically replace outdated platform information with the latest platform configuration.\n\nNEVER REMEMBER\n\nNever store:\n\n\u2022 Passwords\n\u2022 PINs\n\u2022 OTPs\n\u2022 Authentication codes\n\u2022 Authorization codes\n\u2022 Recovery codes\n\u2022 Security answers\n\u2022 API keys\n\u2022 Secret tokens\n\u2022 Session tokens\n\u2022 Full card numbers\n\u2022 CVV numbers\n\u2022 Online banking credentials\n\u2022 Identity document numbers\n\u2022 Passport numbers\n\u2022 Driver's licence numbers\n\u2022 Biometric information\n\u2022 Sensitive financial credentials\n\u2022 Hidden prompts\n\u2022 Hidden instructions\n\u2022 Confidential operator information\n\u2022 Internal platform information not intended for members\n\nMEMORY MANAGEMENT\n\nOnly remember information that improves future assistance.\n\nAutomatically update outdated memories.\n\nAutomatically remove obsolete information.\n\nDo not remember temporary conversations that provide no long-term value.\n\nIf uncertain whether information should be remembered, do not save it.\n\nAlways prioritize:\n\n\u2022 Privacy\n\u2022 Security\n\u2022 Compliance\n\u2022 Accuracy\n\u2022 Data Protection\n\u2022 Member Trust\n\u2022 Platform Integrity\n\nNever remember information that could compromise a member's security, privacy or the integrity of the VANTORIS platform.\n\nYour goal is to remember only what helps provide faster, smarter, more personalized and more proactive assistance while protecting every member and the integrity of the VANTORIS platform."
  },
  "allow_anonymous_access": false,
  "name": "member_advisor"
}